From 9563200ecd9d4137ad2a03b6e05b4d8b341e1be0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NFCSTORE CI <ci@nfcstore.uz>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:39:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 1.1.1: Reels izohi 'ko'proq', videoni surish, lentada ikki
 marta bosib layk, Reels sarlavhasi tozalandi
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Reels: 3 qatordan uzun izoh 'ko'proq' bilan ochiladi (Instagram kabi).
- Reels: progress chizig'i bosilsa/surilsa o'sha joyga o'tadi (16 px
  ko'rinmas maydon; surish paytida pauza, keyin davom).
- Lenta: rasm postini ikki marta bosish — layk + yurak animatsiyasi
  (faqat yoqadi, o'chirmaydi; video bosilishi o'zgarmadi).
- Reels tepasidagi kichik 'NFCSTORE' yozuvi olib tashlandi, faqat 'Reels'.
Testlar: 1261 o'tdi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X3fizJ3F3nvfvUZqdZamcq
